  "pitfalls": [
    "Copy the names into `authors` before you drop `books.author`, or the data is gone.",
    "Add `notNull()` when every book needs an author: a null skips the foreign key check.",
    "Foreign keys get no automatic index: index `author_id` if you filter by it."
  ],
